    My focus is on **Track 1: Agent architecture design** for better planning. To understand how to implement an RNN-based network for this task, I will review the existing "RNN + Policy Gradient" baseline. This will provide a practical example of how to define a recurrent network that integrates with the provided `train_single.py` and `defaults.py` framework.


