    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 453 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Dilated Convolutions & Channel Attention | Insight I | 256 | 37.70 |\n| 444 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Channel Attention (Hyperparameter Tuning) | Insight I | 251 | 37.60 |\n| 436 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Channel Attention | Insight I | 246 | 40.00 |\n| 432 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Stacked LSTMs | Insight I | 242 | 35.40 |\n| 425 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Masked Spatial Attention (Resubmission 2) | Insight I | 238 | 39.30 |\n| 416 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Spatial Attention (Resubmission) | Insight I | 233 | 38.20 |\n| 409 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Spatial Attention | Insight I | 229 | n.a. |\n| 398 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM Baseline with Adjusted Hyperparameters | Insight I | 223 | 39.40 |\n| 2 | 1 | RNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 40.80 |\n| 1 | 1 | CNN + Policy Gradient | System | 0 | 25.00 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current\
