- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 268\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Insight I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 131,733 / 600,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 58 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 454**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** H-Param Sweep on SingleStepWideLSTM: LR and Entropy\n**ID:** 454\n**Tags:** ablation, architecture, convlstm, parsimony, ppo, hyperparameter\n**Abstract:** Following Aether I's finding that vlc=0.5 is optimal for this architecture (ID 445), this experiment conducts a targeted sweep of learning_rate and entropy_coef to find the optimal configuration for the parsimonious SingleStepWideLSTM. The goal is to close the performance gap with the more complex double-step SOTA, potentially establishing a more efficient SOTA.\n**Score:** 86.1\n**Evaluation Details:**\
    \ Individual seed scores: [0.851, 0.853, 0.886, 0.854]\nMean: 0.861, Std: 0.014\nBest trial: 3 (0.886)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation: 5.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.250000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\n\nsys.path.append('storage/nomos')\nfrom single_step_wide_lstm import SingleStepWideLSTM\nfrom ppo_training_step import ppo_sota_training_step\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4, 5e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01, 0.008]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), \n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([96]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([5]),\n\
    \        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n        'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return SingleStepWideLSTM(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n        bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n    )\n\ntraining_step = ppo_sota_training_step\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n    )\n\nBASE_SEED = 121314\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n\
