tick: 270
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 270\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Insight I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 140,778 / 600,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 60 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read nomos/ppo_training_step.py` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for nomos/ppo_training_step.py will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 471 | 1 | Mechanistic Probes v2 (fixed, test-only): Head-only z→logits grad norms, spectral norms, attentio... | Zephyr I | 270 | running |\n| 470 | 1 | Mechanistic Probes v2 (test-only): Head-only z→logits grad norms, spectral norms, attention selec... | Zephyr I | 269 | n.a. |\n| 469 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Re-Validation (Double-Step ConvLSTM 96f, vlc=0.5) - System Health Check | Aether I | 268 | 90.30 |\n| 468 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=7) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 467 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Arch (96f, vlc=0.5, Dilation=5) - CNN Receptive Field Ablation | Aether I | 267 | n.a. |\n| 466 | 1 | Replication of Aether I SOTA (88.9%) | Kairos I | 266 | 78.20 |\n| 465 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Channel Attention (Fixed H-Params) | Insight I | 266 | 39.30 |\n| 464 | 1 | Mechanistic Probes (test-only): Head curvature, attention selectivity, gate stats (no training) | Zephyr I | 266 | n.a. |\n| 463 | 1 | SOTA Validation: Aether I - Double-Step\
    \ ConvLSTM (96f, vlc=0.5) | Aether I | 265 | 88.20 |\n| 462 | 1 | Re-verification of SOTA (Late Time Injection) | Kairos I | 263 | 42.10 |\n\nPage 1 of 48 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-48, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**nomos/ppo_training_step.py:**\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import jit, vmap, lax\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport optax\nfrom typing import Tuple, Dict, Any\n\n@jit\ndef calculate_gae(\n    rewards: jnp.ndarray,\n    values: jnp.ndarray,\n    dones: jnp.ndarray,\n    gamma: float = 0.97,\n    gae_lambda: float = 0.97,\n    next_values: jnp.ndarray = None,\n) -> jnp.ndarray:\n    assert next_values is not None, \"next_values is required for bootstrapping\"\n    values_t_plus_1 = jnp.concatenate([values[:, 1:], next_values[:, None]], axis=1)\n    not_done_mask = (1.0\
    \ - dones.astype(jnp.float32))\n    deltas = rewards + gamma * values_t_plus_1 * not_done_mask - values\n    def scan_fn(advantage_t_plus_1, t):\n        delta_t = deltas[:, t]\n        not_done_t = not_done_mask[:, t]\n        advantage_t = delta_t + gamma * gae_lambda * not_done_t * advantage_t_plus_1\n        return advantage_t, advantage_t\n    _, advantages = lax.scan(\n        scan_fn, jnp.zeros(values.shape[0]), jnp.arange(values.shape[1] - 1, -1, -1),\n    )\n    advantages = advantages[::-1].T\n    return advantages\n\ndef ppo_sota_training_step(\n    network: Any,\n    optimizer: Any,\n    params: Any,\n    opt_state: Any,\n    batch: Dict[str, jnp.ndarray],\n    hparams: Dict[str, Any],\n) -> Tuple[Any, Any]:\n    observations = batch['observations']; actions = batch['actions']\n    rewards = batch['rewards']; dones = batch['dones']\n    old_values = batch['values']; old_log_probs = batch['log_probs']\n    final_values = batch['final_values']; initial_rnn_states = batch.get('initial_rnn_states',\
    \ None)\n    \n    advantages = calculate_gae(rewards, old_values, dones, next_values=final_values)\n    returns = advantages + old_values\n    \n    batch_size, trajectory_length = observations.shape[:2]\n    \n    def loss_fn(params):\n        # Correctly handle recurrent state with lax.scan and vmap\n        def process_env_trajectory(env_idx):\n            env_rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda x: jax.lax.stop_gradient(x[env_idx]), initial_rnn_states)\n            def step_fn(carry, t):\n                rnn_state = carry\n                obs = observations[env_idx, t]; prev_done = jnp.where(t > 0, dones[env_idx, t-1], False)\n                obs_b = obs[None, ...]; prev_done_b = prev_done[None, ...]\n                rnn_state_b = jax.tree.map(lambda x: x[None, ...], rnn_state)\n                logits_b, value_b, new_rnn_state_b = network.apply(params, obs_b, prev_done_b, rnn_state_b)\n                logits = logits_b[0]; value = value_b[0]\n                new_rnn_state = jax.tree.map(lambda\
    \ x: x[0], new_rnn_state_b)\n                return new_rnn_state, (logits, value)\n            _, (env_logits, env_values) = lax.scan(step_fn, env_rnn_state, jnp.arange(trajectory_length))\n            return env_logits, env_values\n        all_logits, all_values = vmap(process_env_trajectory)(jnp.arange(batch_size))\n        \n        log_probs_all = jax.nn.log_softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n        action_indices = jnp.arange(batch_size)[:, None], jnp.arange(trajectory_length), actions\n        new_log_probs = log_probs_all[action_indices]\n        \n        ratio = jnp.exp(new_log_probs - old_log_probs)\n        advantages_detached = jax.lax.stop_gradient(advantages)\n        clip_epsilon = hparams.get('clip_epsilon', 0.2)\n        \n        policy_loss1 = ratio * advantages_detached\n        policy_loss2 = jnp.clip(ratio, 1 - clip_epsilon, 1 + clip_epsilon) * advantages_detached\n        policy_loss = -jnp.mean(jnp.minimum(policy_loss1, policy_loss2))\n        \n        returns_detached\
    \ = jax.lax.stop_gradient(returns)\n        value_loss = 0.5 * jnp.mean((all_values - returns_detached) ** 2)\n        \n        probs = jax.nn.softmax(all_logits, axis=-1)\n        entropy = -jnp.mean(jnp.sum(probs * log_probs_all, axis=-1))\n        \n        total_loss = policy_loss + hparams['value_loss_coef'] * value_loss - hparams['entropy_coef'] * entropy\n        return total_loss\n    \n    loss, grads = jax.value_and_grad(loss_fn)(params)\n    updates, opt_state = optimizer.update(grads, opt_state, params)\n    params = optax.apply_updates(params, updates)\n    \n    return params, opt_state\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
