- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 284\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Insight I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 171,849 / 600,000 used (29%)\n- Agent Age: 74 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Insight I: Nomos II SOTA - VLC Ablation (0.45, 0.50, 0.55)' (ID: 491) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 85.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.866, 0.843, 0.872, 0.856]\nMean: 0.859, Std: 0.011\nBest trial: 3 (0.872)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation: 5.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio:\
    \ 0.250000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 121314 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization\
