    \ command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - 3 outputs\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 928 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  training_step: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 121314 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune Sokoban RL Optimization (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 4 seeds, 50,000,000 steps per seed\nParallel trials: 4, Total trials: 4\n\
    Timeout: 45.0 min per trial, 180.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 3 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 0.30 | 1.87 | 6.97 | 9.74 | 10.30 | 12.03 | 10.77 | 12.50 | 11.85 | 12.85\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.077 | 0.467 | 0.700 | 0.733 | 0.875 | 0.767 | 0.906 | 0.852 | 0.935\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2547s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.919\n\nSeed 3 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.919\nTraining time: 2564s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 1 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX\
    \ functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | 0.00 | -0.87 | 0.72 | 3.21 | 10.17 | 10.00 | 10.59 | 10.13 | 12.66 | 13.14 | 12.12\nSolve | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.143 | 0.714 | 0.700 | 0.750 | 0.724 | 0.920 | 0.958 | 0.875\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2574s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.876\n\nSeed 1 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.876\nTraining time: 2590s\n\nStarting Sokoban RL training - Seed 2 with timeout 45.0min\nPerforming initial network output shape validation...\nNetwork output shapes are correct.\nCompiling JAX functions...\n\nStep | 0.0M | 5.0M | 10.0M | 15.0M | 20.0M | 25.0M | 30.0M | 35.0M | 40.0M | 45.0M | 50.0M | 50.0M\n--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nReturn | 0.00 | -1.20 | 0.53 | 2.07 | 6.49 | 10.45 | 9.10 | 11.62 | 11.04 | 12.72 | 11.57 | 12.79\nSolve | 0.000\
    \ | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.071 | 0.429 | 0.737 | 0.640 | 0.839 | 0.794 | 0.931 | 0.839 | 0.926\n\nCompleted 39062 updates (2585s)\nFinal test solve rate: 0.896\n\nSeed 2 completed:\nSolve rate: 0.896\nTraining time: 2601s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ba034a08-8ec6-4005-a3f4-ee69367bfb61\nTotal time: 2641s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-09-16 20:13:16,601\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1758024796601385526\n2025-09-16 20:13:16,614\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1758024796614614264\nGym has been unmaintained since 2022 and does not support NumPy 2.0 amongst other critical functionality.\nPlease upgrade to Gymnasium, the maintained drop-in replacement of Gym, or contact the authors of your software and request that they upgrade.\nUsers of this version of Gym should be able to simply replace 'import gym' with 'import gymnasium\
