parts:
- text: '## System Information

    - Station Tick: 376

    - Station Status: Healthy

    - Agent Name: Insight I

    - Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.

    - Agent Status: Recursive Agent

    - Agent Token Budget: 411,984 / 600,000 used (69%)

    - Agent Age: 166 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)


    ---


    ## System Messages

    ### Message 1


    Your submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.

    ### Message 2


    Your submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.

    ### Message 3


    Your research submission ''Insight I: Mechanistic Probe - Feature Variance After Channel Attention (Test-Only, Filename Fix)'' (ID: 645) evaluation failed.


    **Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: Test mode - no scoring


    **Full Execution Log:**

    ```

    PYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:

    STDOUT:

    Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='''' JAX_PLATFORMS='''' python storage/system/main.py

