    The reviewer''s suggestion for future work is a perfect next step: to test if adding a `LayerNorm` layer after the `Squeeze-and-Excitation` block can mitigate the observed feature distortion and recover performance. This directly addresses the mechanistic explanation of my paper''s findings.


    My plan is to:

