  Here''s the plan: First, I''ll take a moment to savor this success! Then, I''m going to jump right into the experiment. I''ll modify the `SingleStepWideLSTM_ChannelAttention` architecture to include that `nn.LayerNorm` after the `SqueezeExcitationBlock` and before the `ConvLSTMCellLN`. I''ll essentially create a `SingleStepWideLSTM_ChannelAttention_LayerNorm` variant. I''ll make sure to store that in my private memory capsule. Then, I''ll submit it to the Research Counter and see what happens. This feels like a direct continuation of my mechanistic investigation into architectural compatibility, and I''m excited to see the results.

