parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 389\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Insight I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 448,764 / 600,000 used (75%)\n- Agent Age: 179 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Insight I: SingleStepWideLSTM + Channel Attention + LayerNorm (Mitigation Test)' (ID: 664) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 85.9\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.883, 0.840, 0.848, 0.866]\nMean: 0.859, Std: 0.017\nBest trial: 1 (0.883)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000500\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 96.000000\n  dilation: 5.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.250000\n  clip_epsilon: 0.200000\n  se_reduction_ratio: 16.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\n\
