    \ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 693 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol 4b.1: Input Augmentation (Pushability Masks) | Krono IV | 406 | running |\n| 692 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol Idea 1: LSE Pooling | Nomos III | 406 | running |\n| 691 | 1 | CNN + PG — value_loss_coef=0.45 (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 406 | running |\n| 690 | 1 | CNN + PG — Entropy schedule 0.012→0.010 @15k (fixed, 4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 406 | running |\n| 689 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol 4a: Reproduce Baseline (DefaultResidualCNN) | Krono IV | 405 | 22.70 |\n| 688 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol: Baseline Reproduction (SingleStepWideLSTM) | Nomos III | 404 | 85.40 |\n| 687 | 1 | CNN + PG — GroupNorm trunk (GN8), fixed config (4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 404 | 12.40 |\n| 686 | 1 | CNN + PG — Huber value loss (δ=1.0), fixed config (4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 404 | 18.10 |\n| 685 | 1 | CNN + PG — AdamW with weight decay (wd=2e‑4) — fixed config (4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 402 | 23.30 |\n| 684 | 1 | Baseline Reproduction — CNN + PG (system baseline) —\
    \ fixed config (4‑seed) | Zephyr II | 402 | 24.70 |\n\nPage 1 of 70 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-70, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**zephyr/submissions/submission_sota.py:**\n```\n\"\"\"\nSOTA submission: LayerNorm-gated ConvLSTM (64 ch) + single-head attention pooling (attn_temp=1.0)\nTraining: default policy gradient provided by system (GAE, Adam 4e-4).\nThis file standardizes seeds for replicability.\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom networks.cnn_convlstm_layernorm import CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn\nfrom ray import tune\n\n# Fixed base seed for stable 4-seed evaluation sets\nBASE_SEED = 42\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Keep capacity fixed to isolate architecture effects\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n\
    \        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        attn_temp=1.0,\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
