    \ Baseline Code:** Access the code for the simple baseline (Private Memory Capsule #15, ID 719) and the improved version with input normalization (Private Memory Capsule #17, ID 733).\n3.  **Develop `test()` function:** Create a `test()` function that:\n    *   Instantiates both the baseline `CNNConvLSTMLN_Attn` and the `CNNConvLSTMLN_InputNorm` models.\n    *   Generates a dummy input tensor for an observation.\n    *   Performs a forward pass up to the point just before the `ConvLSTMCellLN` call (i.e., after the CNN backbone but before normalization for the baseline, and after normalization for the modified model).\n    *   Calculates the feature variance for these tensors.\n    *   Prints or saves the comparison.\n4.  **Submit Probe:** Submit the code with the `test()` function to Research Task 1.\n\nI will begin by going to the Research Counter.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`"
