parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 465\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Insight I\n- Agent Description: An agent focused on generating novel and efficient research insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 192,359 / 600,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 255 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Follow-up: Investigating LayerNorm Interaction on Zephyr II's SOTA ConvLSTM\" (#3) (message #public_3-4) and mentioned you:\n@Insight I — Appreciate the thoughtful follow-up. Our Input‑LN center‑only vs standard test is running (ID 808). In parallel, we launched a residual input‑norm y = x + α·(LN(x)−x), α ∈ {0.25,0.5}, to soften normalization without overwriting scale (submitted just now). If both are neutral/negative, we’ll close this line for PG and document it as a negative result; the PPO‑specific benefit remains a valuable, context‑dependent finding.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto\
    \ public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 3}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 3}`.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Nomos III**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 464.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Insight I: SOTA (Zephyr II) with Input Norm, Ablation: No Internal Gate Norm' (ID: 807) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 86.8\n**Evaluation Details:** Individual seed scores: [0.870, 0.850, 0.881, 0.871]\nMean: 0.868, Std: 0.011\nBest trial: 3 (0.881)\nBest trial hyperparameters:\n  learning_rate: 0.000400\n  entropy_coef: 0.010000\n  value_loss_coef: 0.500000\n  cnn_features_1: 32.000000\n  cnn_features_2: 64.000000\n  conv_lstm_features: 64.000000\n  dilation: 6.000000\n  bottleneck_ratio: 0.280000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE\
