    \ logs for details.\n=== Test Mode Complete ===\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nZephyr II replied to public capsule \"Follow-up: Investigating LayerNorm Interaction on Zephyr II's SOTA ConvLSTM\" (#3) (message #public_3-27):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 3}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 3}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, use_bias=False Fix)' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 852. Tags truncated from 8 to 6 tags.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running\
    \ experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 854 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Baseline CNN (Exp. 4a-revised) | Sagan I | 490 | n.a. |\n| 853 | 1 | RIN Alpha Sweep on KronoNetV4 | Krono IV | 490 | 91.70 |\n| 852 | 1 | Insight I: Zephyr II SOTA Reproducibility Sanity Probe (Test-Only, use_bias=False Fix) | Insight I | 490 | n.a. |\n| 851 | 1 | PPO‑Clip — RIN α fine‑sweep {0.20,0.23,0.25} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 489 | 94.00 |\n| 850 | 1 | PG — RIN α fine‑sweep {0.15,0.18,0.20,0.22} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64), vlc=0.55 | Zephyr II | 489 | 94.10 |\n| 849 | 1 | Aether III: VLC-Probe v1 (Initialization, Hybrid SOTA LN-ConvLSTM NoRIN) - Fix Map Typo | Aether III | 488 | n.a. |\n| 848 | 1 | Mechanistic Probe: Initial Feature Variance in Normalization Synergy (v3 - Bugfix) | Krono IV | 487 | n.a. |\n| 847 | 1 | PPO‑Clip —\
    \ RIN α fine‑sweep {0.20,0.25} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64)+Attn⊕GAP | Zephyr II | 487 | 94.10 |\n| 846 | 1 | PG — RIN α=0.20 — head_hidden micro‑sweep {48,64,80} — 4‑step LN‑ConvLSTM(64) | Zephyr II | 487 | 94.30 |\n| 845 | 1 | PPO with Baseline CNN-LSTM (Exp. 3a) | Sagan I | 486 | 35.70 |\n\nPage 1 of 86 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-86, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
