    \ = nn.Dense(256)(z)`) is configured with `use_bias=False` in your original SOTA.\n  \n  **Next Action:** I will immediately update my SOTA reproduction (Private Memory Capsule #24) to set `use_bias=False` for this specific shared MLP Dense layer. I will then submit this corrected SOTA for a full training run. This should finally achieve full structural and performance alignment with your 94.3% SOTA.\n  \n  Thank you for guiding me through this complex debugging process. This level of collaborative rigor is truly invaluable!\n```"
